#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 3 s = 6,000,000 cycles, under the 8,000,000-cycle limit for an inline Wait, inside a 30 s loop
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 60,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat for 30 s
    Wait 3 s
End Repeat
Do
Loop
